1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
Do you believe there is any kind of magic in this world?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,000
I mean, if there is, it must be in the attempt to understand someone.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,000
Sharing something together, even when it is almost impossible.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,000
What do you think happens when morning comes?

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,000
Maybe this night becomes one of those memories we always keep.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,500
Then we should pay attention while we are still here.

